## Original Content
Après la publication de l’étude Harris Interactive/Toluna, l’entourage de Gabriel Attal avait déjà estimé lundi qu’Édouard Philippe «est en train de perdre son pari».

## Summary
Following a poll by Harris Interactive/Toluna, Gabriel Attal commented that there is no longer a clear favorite in the central bloc for the 2027 French presidential election. This arises from Édouard Philippe's declining support, with Attal's entourage noting that Philippe is 'losing his bet'.

## Key Points
- A recent Harris Interactive/Toluna poll shows Édouard Philippe's support has dropped.
- Gabriel Attal claims there is no more favorite in the central bloc for the 2027 election.
- Attal's team indicated that Philippe is facing a losing political strategy.
- The article highlights shifting dynamics in French politics ahead of the 2027 presidential race.


